# **Use Predefined Theme Values**

Always use predefined values from [theme.json](mdc:theme.json) instead of arbitrary spacing, typography, colors, or other design tokens. This ensures design consistency and maintains the theme's design system.

## **Color Values**

### ✅ DO: Use Theme Color Palette
```html
<!-- Use predefined color slugs -->
<!-- wp:group {"backgroundColor":"neutral-100","textColor":"neutral-900"} -->
<!-- wp:button {"backgroundColor":"primary","textColor":"white"} -->
<!-- wp:heading {"textColor":"accent"} -->
```

```css
/* Use CSS custom properties for colors */
.my-element {
    background-color: var(--wp--preset--color--neutral-100);
    color: var(--wp--preset--color--neutral-900);
    border-color: var(--wp--preset--color--accent);
}
```

### ❌ DON'T: Use Arbitrary Color Values
```html
<!-- Avoid hardcoded colors -->
<!-- wp:group {"style":{"color":{"background":"#f5f5f5","text":"#333333"}}} -->
<!-- wp:button {"style":{"color":{"background":"#ff0000"}}} -->
```

```css
/* Avoid arbitrary hex/rgb values */
.my-element {
    background-color: #f5f5f5; /* Use neutral-100 instead */
    color: #333333; /* Use neutral-700 instead */
    border-color: #007cba; /* Use accent instead */
}
```

## **Available Colors from [theme.json](mdc:theme.json)**
- `black` (#000000), `white` (#ffffff)
- `primary` (#000000), `secondary` (#ffffff), `accent` (#007cba)
- `neutral-50` through `neutral-900` (full neutral scale)
- Gradients: `primary-accent`, `neutral-fade`

## **Typography Values**

### ✅ DO: Use Theme Font Sizes
```html
<!-- Use predefined font size slugs -->
<!-- wp:heading {"fontSize":"3xl"} -->
<!-- wp:paragraph {"fontSize":"large"} -->
<!-- wp:button {"fontSize":"medium"} -->
```

```css
/* Use CSS custom properties for typography */
.my-text {
    font-size: var(--wp--preset--font-size--large);
    font-family: var(--wp--preset--font-family--heading);
}
```

### ❌ DON'T: Use Arbitrary Font Sizes
```html
<!-- Avoid hardcoded font sizes -->
<!-- wp:heading {"style":{"typography":{"fontSize":"32px"}}} -->
<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"fontSize":"18px"}}} -->
```

```css
/* Avoid arbitrary font sizes */
.my-text {
    font-size: 18px; /* Use var(--wp--preset--font-size--large) instead */
    font-size: 1.5rem; /* Use predefined size token instead */
}
```

## **Available Font Sizes from [theme.json](mdc:theme.json)**
- `2xs` (0.512rem), `xs` (0.64rem), `small` (0.8rem)
- `base` (1rem), `medium` (1.25rem), `large` (1.563rem)
- `xl` (1.953rem), `2xl` (2.441rem), `3xl` (3.052rem)
- **Heading-specific**: `h1` through `h6` for heading blocks

## **Available Font Families from [theme.json](mdc:theme.json)**
- `system` (system font stack)
- `body` (sans-serif)
- `heading` (serif)

## **Spacing Values**

### ✅ DO: Use Theme Spacing Scale
```html
<!-- Use predefined spacing in block attributes -->
<!-- wp:group {"style":{"spacing":{"padding":"var:preset|spacing|large"}}} -->
<!-- wp:spacer {"height":"var:preset|spacing|xl"} -->
<!-- wp:group {"style":{"spacing":{"margin":{"top":"var:preset|spacing|medium"}}}} -->
```

```css
/* Use CSS custom properties for spacing */
.my-element {
    padding: var(--wp--preset--spacing--large);
    margin-top: var(--wp--preset--spacing--medium);
    gap: var(--wp--preset--spacing--small);
}
```

### ❌ DON'T: Use Arbitrary Spacing Values
```html
<!-- Avoid hardcoded spacing -->
<!-- wp:group {"style":{"spacing":{"padding":"2rem"}}} -->
<!-- wp:spacer {"height":"32px"} -->
<!-- wp:group {"style":{"spacing":{"margin":{"top":"1.5rem"}}}} -->
```

```css
/* Avoid arbitrary spacing values */
.my-element {
    padding: 2rem; /* Use var(--wp--preset--spacing--large) instead */
    margin-top: 24px; /* Use predefined spacing token instead */
    gap: 1rem; /* Use var(--wp--preset--spacing--base) instead */
}
```

## **Available Spacing Sizes from [theme.json](mdc:theme.json)**
- `2xs` (0.512rem), `xs` (0.64rem), `small` (0.8rem)
- `base` (1rem), `medium` (1.25rem), `large` (1.563rem)
- `xl` (1.953rem), `2xl` (2.441rem), `3xl` (3.052rem)

## **Shadow Values**

### ✅ DO: Use Theme Shadow Presets
```css
.my-element {
    box-shadow: var(--wp--preset--shadow--natural);
    /* or */
    box-shadow: var(--wp--preset--shadow--deep);
}
```

### ❌ DON'T: Use Arbitrary Shadow Values
```css
.my-element {
    box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); /* Use preset instead */
}
```

## **Layout Values**

### ✅ DO: Use Theme Layout Constraints
```html
<!-- Use theme layout settings -->
<!-- wp:group {"layout":{"type":"constrained"}} -->
<!-- wp:group {"layout":{"type":"constrained","contentSize":"1280px"}} -->
```

```css
/* Use theme layout values */
.content-area {
    max-width: var(--wp--style--global--content-size); /* 1280px */
}

.wide-content {
    max-width: var(--wp--style--global--wide-size); /* 1400px */
}
```

### ❌ DON'T: Use Arbitrary Layout Values
```css
.content-area {
    max-width: 1200px; /* Use theme content-size instead */
}
```

## **Validation Checklist**

Before committing template or style changes:

- [ ] All colors use theme palette slugs or CSS custom properties
- [ ] All font sizes use predefined typography scale
- [ ] All spacing uses theme spacing scale
- [ ] No hardcoded pixel, rem, or em values in templates
- [ ] Shadows use predefined shadow presets
- [ ] Layout widths use theme layout constraints

## **Quick Reference**

**CSS Custom Property Format:**
- Colors: `var(--wp--preset--color--{slug})`
- Font sizes: `var(--wp--preset--font-size--{slug})`
- Font families: `var(--wp--preset--font-family--{slug})`
- Spacing: `var(--wp--preset--spacing--{slug})`
- Shadows: `var(--wp--preset--shadow--{slug})`

**Block Template Format:**
- Colors: `"textColor":"slug"` or `"backgroundColor":"slug"`
- Font sizes: `"fontSize":"slug"`
- Spacing: `"style":{"spacing":{"padding":"var:preset|spacing|slug"}}`

**Exception Cases:**
- Responsive units (`vw`, `vh`, `%`) may be used when appropriate
- One-off adjustments should be rare and well-documented
- Always prefer theme tokens over arbitrary values
